# NOTHING in this directory is committed except this file.
#
# The descriptors here name a private GitLab namespace and the packages that are
# deliberately withheld from the published page. Atlas is a generic tool; its
# repo must not carry one company's inventory, and internal/guard has a test
# that fails the build on org strings in source for exactly that reason.
#
# check.sh and the descriptors live here so the harness sits beside the code it
# exercises, but they stay untracked. If this harness is ever worth sharing,
# commit a descriptor with placeholder names — not these.
#
# Also ignored for the ordinary reasons: the binary (built on every run, so a
# checked-in one could silently report on stale code) and out-*/ pages.
*
!.gitignore
